[
  {
    "content_id": "10060001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是耶稣基督的使徒彼得，写信给寄居在本都、加拉太、加帕多迦、亚细亚、庇推尼各地的上帝选民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们按照父上帝预先定好的旨意蒙了拣选，借着圣灵得以圣洁，好顺服耶稣基督，并靠祂的血得到洁净。 愿上帝多多赐给你们恩典和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;愿颂赞归于我们主耶稣基督的父上帝！祂怀着极大的怜悯，透过耶稣基督从死里复活，使我们获得重生，有活泼的盼望，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;可以承受那不会朽坏、不会腐烂、不会衰残、为你们存留在天上的产业。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们这些因信而蒙上帝用大能保守的人，必能得到那已经预备好、在末世要显明的救恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;为此，即使现今你们必须暂时在百般试炼中忍受痛苦，也要满怀喜乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;这样，你们的信心经过考验后，比那经过火炼仍会坏掉的金子更加宝贵，使你们可以在耶稣基督显现时得到称赞、荣耀和尊贵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们虽然没有见过祂，却爱祂；虽然现在看不见祂，却信祂，并且有无法形容、充满荣耀的喜乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因为你们得到了信心带来的果效，就是你们的灵魂得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;有关这救恩，那些预言恩典要临到你们的众先知早已详细寻求和查考了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;基督的灵曾在他们心中指示他们，预言基督要受苦，然后得荣耀。他们便详细查考这些事在何时、何境况下发生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他们得到启示，知道他们传讲这些事不是为了自己，而是为了你们。现在，那些靠着从天上差来的圣灵向你们传福音的人，已经将这些事传给你们了。连天使也渴望把这些事看个明白。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;所以，要预备好你们的心，谨慎自律，专心盼望耶稣基督显现时要带给你们的恩典。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们既是顺服的儿女，就不要再像从前无知的时候那样放纵私欲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;那呼召你们的是圣洁的，你们的一切行为也要圣洁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因为圣经上说：“你们要圣洁，因为我是圣洁的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;既然你们称呼那位按各人的行为公正无私地审判人的上帝为父，就应该存着敬畏的心过你们在世上寄居的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;要知道，你们从传统的、没有意义的生活中被救赎出来，不是靠金银等会朽坏的东西，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;而是靠无瑕无疵的代罪羔羊基督的宝血。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;基督是上帝在创世以前预先拣选的，却在这末世为你们显现。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你们借着基督信了使祂从死里复活、赐祂荣耀的上帝，所以，你们的信心和盼望都在于上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你们既因顺服真理，洁净了自己的心，能够真诚地爱弟兄姊妹，就当以清洁的心彼此切实相爱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;你们获得重生，不是借着会腐烂的种子，而是借着不会腐烂的种子——上帝活泼永存的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;因为 “芸芸众生尽如草， 荣华纷缛草上花； 草必枯干花必残，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60001025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;唯有主道永长存。” 这道就是传给你们的福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;因此，你们要除去一切恶毒、欺诈、虚伪、嫉妒和毁谤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;要像初生的婴儿爱慕奶一样渴慕纯净的灵奶，好不断成长，直到完全得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因为你们尝过主恩的滋味是何等甘美。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;主是活石，虽然被人弃绝，却被上帝拣选、视为宝贵。你们来到祂面前，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;也如同活石，被用来建造属灵的宫殿，好做圣洁的祭司，借着耶稣基督献上蒙上帝悦纳的灵祭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;因为圣经上说： “看啊，我在锡安放了一块石头，一块蒙拣选的宝贵房角石， 信靠祂的人必不会蒙羞。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;所以，这石头对你们信的人而言，是宝贵的；但对那些不信的人而言，却是： “工匠丢弃的石头， 已成了房角石。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;也是： “绊脚石和使人跌倒的磐石。” 他们跌倒是因为他们不顺服真道，这早已注定了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但你们是蒙拣选的族群，是君尊的祭司，是圣洁的国度，是上帝的子民，为了要宣扬上帝的美德。祂曾呼召你们离开黑暗，进入祂奇妙的光明。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;从前你们不是上帝的子民，现在却做了祂的子民；从前你们未蒙怜悯，现在却蒙了怜悯。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄姊妹，你们是客旅，是寄居的，我劝你们要禁戒与灵魂为敌的邪情私欲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你们在异教徒当中要品行端正。这样，尽管他们毁谤你们是作恶的人，但看见你们的善行，也会在主来的日子把荣耀归给上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;为主的缘故，你们要服从人间的一切权柄，不管是居首位的君王，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;还是被君王派来赏善罚恶的官员。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;因为上帝的旨意是要你们行善，使那些愚昧无知的人哑口无言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你们是自由的人，但不要以自由为借口去犯罪作恶，要做上帝的奴仆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;要尊重所有的人，爱主内的弟兄姊妹，敬畏上帝，尊敬君王。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你们做奴仆的，要存敬畏的心顺服主人，不但顺服那良善温和的，也要顺服那凶暴的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;因为你们若为了让良心对得起上帝而忍受冤屈之苦，必蒙上帝悦纳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;如果你们犯罪受责打，能够忍耐，有什么功劳呢？但如果你们因行善而受苦，还能忍耐，就是上帝所喜悦的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你们蒙召也是为此，因为基督也为你们受过苦，给你们留下榜样，叫你们可以追随祂的脚步。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;祂没有犯罪，口中也没有诡诈。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;祂被辱骂也不还口，被迫害也不扬言报复，只把自己交托给按公义施行审判的上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;祂被钉在十字架上，亲身担当了我们的罪，使我们向着罪死了，可以过公义的生活。因祂所受的鞭伤，你们得到了医治。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60002025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;从前你们好像是迷路的羊，现在却归向了你们灵魂的牧人和监护者。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:1-2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1-2</sup>&nbsp;照样，你们做妻子的要顺服自己的丈夫。这样，即使丈夫不信从真道，也会因为看见妻子贞洁和敬虔的品行而被无声地感化。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们不要注重外表的妆饰，像编头发、戴金饰或穿华丽的衣服，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;要以温柔、娴静这些永不褪色的内在美为妆饰，这是上帝所看重的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;从前那些仰赖上帝的圣洁妇女，都以这些来妆饰自己，并顺服自己的丈夫，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;正如撒拉顺服亚伯拉罕，称他为主人。你们如果做对的事，不怕恐吓，就是撒拉的女儿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你们做丈夫的也一样，要按情理与妻子共同生活，因为她们比你们软弱。要敬重她们，因为她们和你们一同承受生命之恩。这样，你们的祷告就可以畅通无阻了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;总而言之，你们要同心合意，互相关怀，彼此相爱，仁慈谦卑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;不要以恶报恶，以辱骂还辱骂，反要祝福对方，因为这是你们蒙召的目的，好叫你们蒙福。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;圣经上说： “若有人热爱生命， 渴望幸福， 就要舌头不出恶言， 嘴唇不说诡诈的话。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;要弃恶行善，竭力追求和睦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;因为主的眼睛看顾义人， 祂的耳朵垂听他们的祈求。 但主必严惩作恶之人。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;如果你们热心行善，有谁会害你们呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;就算你们为义受苦，也是有福的。不要害怕别人的恐吓，也不要惊慌，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;要从心里尊基督为主。如果有人问起你们心中的盼望，你们要随时准备答复，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;但态度要温和恭敬，存无愧的良心。这样，那些对你们在基督里的好品行妄加诬蔑的人会自觉羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;如果上帝的旨意是要你们因行善而受苦，也总比你们因作恶而受苦强。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;因为基督也曾一次为罪受苦，以无罪之身代替不义之人，为要领你们到上帝面前。祂的肉体虽被处死，但祂借着圣灵复活了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;祂还借着圣灵向那些被监禁的灵魂传道，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;就是从前在挪亚造方舟、上帝耐心等候人们悔改的时代中那些不肯信的人。当时进入方舟，从洪水中得救的人很少，只有八个人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;这水预表的洗礼现在借着耶稣基督的复活也拯救了你们，这洗礼不是要除掉肉体的污秽，而是求在上帝面前有无愧的良心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60003022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;基督已经升到天上，坐在上帝的右边，众天使、掌权的、有能力的都服从了祂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;既然基督在肉体上受过苦，你们也要怀着同样的心志，因为肉体受过苦的人已经与罪断绝了关系，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;可以在今后的生活中不再随从人的私欲，只服从上帝的旨意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们从前长期沉溺于异教徒的嗜好——淫乱、纵欲、醉酒、狂欢、宴乐和可憎的偶像崇拜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;如今你们不再和他们同流合污，他们觉得奇怪，就用恶言毁谤你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;他们将来必须向审判活人和死人的主交账。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;正因如此，福音也曾传给已死的人。这样，他们的肉体虽然像世人一样受了审判，他们的灵魂却可以靠上帝活着。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;万物的尽头快到了。因此，你们要谨慎自律，警醒祷告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;最重要的是要彼此真诚相爱，因为爱可以遮盖许多罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要互相接待，不发怨言，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;按着自己所得的恩赐彼此服侍，做上帝各样恩典的好管家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;能讲道的，要按着上帝的话去讲；能服侍人的，要本着上帝所赐的力量去服侍。这样，上帝会借着耶稣基督在一切事上得到荣耀。 愿荣耀和权能都归给祂，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄姊妹，若有火一般的试炼临到你们，不要觉得奇怪，好像发生了什么不寻常的事，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;反倒要欢喜，因为你们是与基督一起受苦。这样，你们在祂的荣耀显现时可以和祂一同欢喜快乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;如果你们为基督的缘故受辱骂，就有福了！因为上帝荣耀的灵常住在你们身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你们谁也不可因杀人、偷盗、作恶或管闲事而受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;若是为了做基督徒而受苦，不要觉得羞耻，要因这身份归荣耀给上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;因为时候到了，审判要先从上帝的家开始。如果审判从我们开始，那些不信从上帝福音的人又会有怎样的结局呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;如果义人得救尚且不易，不敬虔的人和罪人会有什么下场呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;所以，照上帝旨意受苦的人要继续专心行善，将自己的灵魂交托给那位信实的造物主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我作为长老，也作为基督受苦的见证人和同享将要显明之荣耀的人，劝你们中间做长老的：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;务要牧养上帝托付给你们的羊群，按上帝的旨意照顾他们，不是出于勉强，不是为了谋利，而是出于甘心，出于热诚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;不要辖制托付给你们的羊群，而是要做群羊的榜样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;等到大牧长显现的时候，你们必得到永不衰残的荣耀冠冕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们年轻的要顺服年长的，大家都要存谦卑的心彼此服侍。因为上帝阻挡骄傲的人，恩待谦卑的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;所以你们要在上帝大能的手下谦卑，时候到了，祂必提升你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你们要把一切忧虑卸给祂，因为祂眷顾你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们务要谨慎、警醒，因为你们的仇敌魔鬼好像咆哮的狮子四处游走，寻找可以吞吃的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你们要以坚定的信心抵挡它，要知道世界各地的弟兄姊妹在遭受同样的苦难。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你们忍受短暂的苦难之后，广施恩典、在基督里呼召你们享受祂永远荣耀的上帝必亲自复兴你们，使你们刚强、笃定、坚立。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;愿权能归给祂，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;在忠心的弟兄西拉的帮助下，我简单地写了这封信劝勉你们，并证明这是上帝真实的恩典。你们务要在这恩典上站稳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;在巴比伦和你们一同蒙拣选的教会问候你们，我的儿子马可也问候你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10060005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得前书 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "60005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们要以爱心彼此亲吻问候。 愿平安归给你们所有在基督里的人！</p>"
  }
]